@startuml 08-adoption-exclusivity-contract-and-return-state
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans SC"
skinparam shadowing false
title 领养、试养、交接与安全接回状态

[*] --> submitted
submitted --> approved : 发布者批准
approved --> trial_proposed : 已有同版生效协议
trial_proposed --> trial_active : 双方同版确认并锁宠物
trial_proposed --> approved : 拒绝试养
trial_active --> handover_pending : 交接确认尚未齐全
approved --> handover_pending : 同版协议及交接核对
handover_pending --> completed : 双方确认
trial_active --> return_requested : 请求接回
handover_pending --> return_requested : 请求接回
return_requested --> return_agreed : 同版方案双确认为effective
return_agreed --> returned : 双方实际交接
note right of return_requested : 拒绝／撤回／过期不等于实际接回
方案历史与领养记录状态分开
note right of trial_active : 同pet_id与adoption_cycle排他；其它申请进入候补
完整拒绝、撤回、补充等支路见rescue.go
@enduml
